#. module: gec_access_manager
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:gec_access_manager.field_gec_access_profile_menu__records
msgid ""
"Used for every screen of this menu that supports the choice. 'Their own "
"records' needs an owner on the record (salesperson, user, employee). 'Their "
"sales team' needs a sales team, and so on. Records without such a field all "
"stay visible."
